---
import { ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <img class="hero-image" src="/images/about-profile.webp" alt="Chen-Ling Lin outdoors" />
    <div class="shell hero-content">
      <p class="hero-name">Chen-Ling Lin · 林貞伶</p>
      <h1 id="home-title">Jennysloth</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">Tracing patterns through numbers, music, and ordinary days.</p>
      <p class="hero-copy-zh" lang="zh-Hant">在數字、音符與尋常日子裡，尋找屬於自己的脈絡。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="now-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-header"><h2 id="now-heading">Now</h2><span class="small muted">Updated September 2026</span></div>
      <div class="now-grid">
        <article class="now-item"><p class="eyebrow">Learning</p><h3>Study & exploration</h3><p>Preparing for IELTS, keeping up with university coursework, and exploring business analytics and broader business topics.</p></article>
        <article class="now-item"><p class="eyebrow">Building</p><h3>Data analytics</h3><p>Preparing a new data analytics project. Completed work will be documented and published here when it is ready.</p></article>
        <article class="now-item"><p class="eyebrow">Playing</p><h3>Clarinet</h3><p>Rehearsing with 屹川管樂團 for the March 27, 2027 concert, while preparing for summer activities with the NCHU Wind Band.</p></article>
        <article class="now-item"><p class="eyebrow">Life</p><h3>Finding balance</h3><p>Trying to find a sustainable balance between studying and resting, while preparing for university coursework and IELTS.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft" aria-labelledby="stories-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-header"><h2 id="stories-heading">Featured Stories</h2><a href="/writing/">All writing</a></div>
      <div class="editorial-grid">
        <article class="story-feature">
          <p class="eyebrow">Life · 7 November 2025</p>
          <h3><a href="/writing/2025-october/">十月記事！</a></h3>
          <p class="lede">十月是非常精彩的一個月，從樂團、課業到生活，在忙碌裡看見一些新的自己。</p>
        </article>
        <div>
          <article class="story-compact"><p class="eyebrow">Life · 4 October 2025</p><h3><a href="/writing/2025-september/">九月記事！</a></h3><p class="muted">社團、課業與日常生活的九月紀錄。</p></article>
          <article class="story-compact"><p class="eyebrow">Website · 25 September 2025</p><h3><a href="/writing/hello-world/">Hello World</a></h3><p class="muted">The beginning of this journal.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-header"><h2 id="projects-heading">Selected Projects</h2><a href="/projects/">View projects</a></div>
      <div class="rule-list">
        <article class="rule-row project-row"><span class="small muted">Technical</span><h3><a href="/projects/academic-portfolio-website/">Academic Portfolio Website</a></h3><a class="arrow" href="/projects/academic-portfolio-website/" aria-label="Open Academic Portfolio Website"><ArrowUpRight size={20} /></a></article>
        <article class="rule-row project-row"><span class="small muted">Academic</span><h3>Coming Soon</h3><span class="arrow muted">In preparation</span></article>
        <article class="rule-row project-row"><span class="small muted">Personal</span><h3>Coming Soon</h3><span class="arrow muted">In preparation</span></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section music-band" aria-labelledby="music-heading">
    <div class="shell music-layout">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Music Journal</p><h2 id="music-heading">A life with the clarinet.</h2><p class="lede">從意外選到單簧管，到在樂團裡重新找回喜歡。音樂是生活裡的成就感，也是紓解壓力的方式。</p><a class="text-link" href="/music/">Read my clarinet story</a></div>
      <div class="performance-list">
        <div class="performance"><span class="small muted">27 Mar 2027</span><div><strong>屹川管樂團</strong><br /><span class="muted">Concert performance</span></div></div>
        <div class="performance"><span class="small muted">Summer 2027</span><div><strong>NCHU Wind Band</strong><br /><span class="muted">Upcoming activities</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the Gallery</p><h2 id="gallery-heading">Summer in the UK, 2026</h2></div><a href="/gallery/">Visit gallery</a></div>
      <div class="photo-strip">
        <figure><div class="photo-placeholder">Manchester · photograph coming soon</div></figure>
        <figure><div class="photo-placeholder">York · photograph coming soon</div></figure>
        <figure><div class="photo-placeholder">London · photograph coming soon</div></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft" aria-labelledby="updates-heading">
    <div class="shell updates">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Recently</p><h2 id="updates-heading">Latest Updates</h2></div>
      <div class="rule-list">
        <div class="rule-row update-row"><span class="small muted">Writing</span><h3><a href="/writing/2025-october/">十月記事！</a></h3></div>
        <div class="rule-row update-row"><span class="small muted">Project</span><h3><a href="/projects/academic-portfolio-website/">Academic Portfolio Website</a></h3></div>
        <div class="rule-row update-row"><span class="small muted">Coursework</span><h3><a href="/notes/coursework/">Junior Year · Fall 2026</a></h3></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
